1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,228
Your towel grows a film
of bacteria.

2
00:00:02,478 --> 00:00:04,174
The claim: use
disposable

3
00:00:04,174 --> 00:00:05,749
towels for ideal skin.

4
00:00:05,749 --> 00:00:07,005
Let's check the receipt.

5
00:00:07,255 --> 00:00:08,152
Line one.

6
00:00:08,152 --> 00:00:09,855
Does that film really
form?

7
00:00:09,855 --> 00:00:11,442
One study gave new
cotton

8
00:00:11,442 --> 00:00:13,396
towels to twenty-six
households.

9
00:00:13,646 --> 00:00:15,679
Six months of normal
home use.

10
00:00:15,679 --> 00:00:17,883
Every two months, they
tested the towels.

11
00:00:18,133 --> 00:00:20,689
By month two, the towels
smelled and looked dull.

12
00:00:20,689 --> 00:00:22,697
Under a microscope:
biofilm.

13
00:00:22,947 --> 00:00:24,464
Live bacteria counts
were

14
00:00:24,464 --> 00:00:25,830
highest at month six.

15
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:27,105
The film kept building.

16
00:00:27,355 --> 00:00:28,510
That line holds up.

17
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:29,660
Line two.

18
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,422
Is it your own skin's
bacteria?

19
00:00:31,422 --> 00:00:32,507
Mostly not.

20
00:00:32,507 --> 00:00:34,449
Staph, a common skin
bacterium,

21
00:00:34,449 --> 00:00:36,694
was typically well under
one percent.

22
00:00:36,944 --> 00:00:39,114
The authors think
bacteria that suit

23
00:00:39,114 --> 00:00:40,989
towel fibres move in and
settle.

24
00:00:41,239 --> 00:00:42,181
Line three.

25
00:00:42,181 --> 00:00:43,860
Does the film hurt your
skin?

26
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:45,266
The study never looked
at

27
00:00:45,266 --> 00:00:47,160
anyone's skin health or
infections.

28
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:49,127
And disposable towels?

29
00:00:49,127 --> 00:00:50,872
This study didn't test
those either.

30
00:00:51,122 --> 00:00:54,250
What dermatologists do
say: never share towels.

31
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:56,137
And pat your skin dry
with a clean one.

32
00:00:56,387 --> 00:00:58,011
Receipt total: unknown.

33
00:00:59,061 --> 00:01:00,258
The film is real.

34
00:01:00,258 --> 00:01:01,538
Harm to your skin?

35
00:01:01,538 --> 00:01:02,462
Unproven.

36
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,012
Disposable towels?

37
00:01:04,012 --> 00:01:04,997
Not tested.

38
00:01:04,997 --> 00:01:07,435
Dermatologists say
clean, and not shared.

39
00:01:07,685 --> 00:01:09,585
A dermatologist can
check your skin.

